### 1. GET post 1 (Returns 200 OK)
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1

### 2. GET non-existing post (Returns 404 Not Found)
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/99999

### 3. GET posts filtered by userId (Returns 200 OK with array)
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts?userId=1

### 4. POST create new post (Returns 201 Created)
POST https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New Compliance Policy",
  "body": "Ensure all client data is securely logged.",
  "userId": 1
}

### 5. PUT update post 1 completely (Returns 200 OK)
PUT https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Updated Compliance Policy",
  "body": "Updated full body text.",
  "userId": 1
}

### 6. PATCH update post 1 partially (Returns 200 OK)
PATCH https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Patched Title Only"
}

### 7. DELETE post 1 (Returns 200 OK - Note: 204 No Content is more idiomatic)
DELETE https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
